mains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/store/test_git_outcome.py tests/unit/store/test_merge_recovery.py tests/unit/store/test_stamped_lock.py tests/unit/store/test_store_paths.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/store/test_git_outcome.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/store/test_merge_recovery.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/store/test_stamped_lock.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/store/test_store_paths.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","ae4d-df34-480d-4c88"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"ae4d-df34-480d-4c88","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"c540-7c26-f979-45d8","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in tests/unit/store","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["e2b3c4f9-e255-4333-b881-46d86fbaf376","cead65ac-c9ce-4f35-86d2-441be9d9636b","928fcad9-812a-467e-8940-802d607d2913","aac777d1-c290-4b41-97b3-af28cf1d7ba8","18c0faa9-bd